[#TallyObjectCreation]

; ==========================================
; Bags Column Configuration for Tally Prime 6.0
; Purpose: Add Bags column to Purchase, Sales & Stock Journal vouchers
; and display in Godown Summary report
; ==========================================

; ==========================================
; VOUCHER MASTER CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[TDL: Voucher Master: Purchase]
Field: Bags Quantity Field List | FVirtualField
Object: Bags Quantity

[TDL: Voucher Master: Sales]
Field: Bags Quantity Field List | FVirtualField
Object: Bags Quantity

[TDL: Voucher Master: Stock Journal]
Field: Bags Quantity Field List | FVirtualField
Object: Bags Quantity

; ==========================================
; STOCK ITEM CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[Field: Bags Quantity Field List]
Use: Bags Quantity
Set As: Bags Quantity

[Object: Bags Quantity]
Type: Quantity
Quantity Type: Bags
Full Form: Bags
Short Form: Bags
Symbol: Bags
Decimals: 0

; ==========================================
; LEDGER ENTRY CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[TDL: Ledger Entry: Purchase]
Field: Bags Quantity | FVirtualField

[TDL: Ledger Entry: Sales]
Field: Bags Quantity | FVirtualField

[TDL: Ledger Entry: Stock Journal]
Field: Bags Quantity | FVirtualField

; ==========================================
; INVENTORY VOUCHER LINES
; ==========================================

[Line: Purchase Line]
Field: Item Name, Item Quantity, Bags Quantity, Rate, Amount
Align: Left, Right, Right, Right, Right

[Line: Sales Line]
Field: Item Name, Item Quantity, Bags Quantity, Rate, Amount
Align: Left, Right, Right, Right, Right

[Line: Stock Journal Line]
Field: Item Name, Item Quantity, Bags Quantity
Align: Left, Right, Right

; ==========================================
; GODOWN SUMMARY REPORT CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[Report: Godown Summary With Bags]
Title: Godown Summary with Bags
Form: Godown Summary Form With Bags
Filter: Godown Summary Filter
Summary: Godown Summary
Print Layout: Godown Summary Layout
Use Method: Godown Summary Method

[Form: Godown Summary Form With Bags]
Part: Godown Header Part
Part: Godown Summary Line Part

[Part: Godown Header Part]
Line: Godown Header Line
Repeat: Godown Summary
Filters: Godown Summary Filter

[Line: Godown Header Line]
Field: Item Name, Godown Name, Unit

[Part: Godown Summary Line Part]
Line: Godown Summary Detail Line
Repeat: Godown Summary

[Line: Godown Summary Detail Line]
Field: Item Name, Opening Quantity, Opening Bags, Inward Quantity, Inward Bags, Outward Quantity, Outward Bags, Closing Quantity, Closing Bags
Align: Left, Right, Right, Right, Right, Right, Right, Right, Right

; ==========================================
; COLUMN DEFINITIONS FOR GODOWN SUMMARY
; ==========================================

[Column: Opening Bags]
Use: Bags Quantity
Set As: Opening Bags Value
Total: Yes

[Column: Inward Bags]
Use: Bags Quantity
Set As: Inward Bags Value
Total: Yes

[Column: Outward Bags]
Use: Bags Quantity
Set As: Outward Bags Value
Total: Yes

[Column: Closing Bags]
Use: Bags Quantity
Set As: Closing Bags Value
Total: Yes

; ==========================================
; FILTER CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[Filter: Godown Summary Filter]
Title: Godown Summary Filter
Selection: Godown
Selection: Item

; ==========================================
; SUMMARY CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================

[Summary: Godown Summary]
Group By: Godown
Sub Group By: Item
Line: Godown Summary Line

[Line: Godown Summary Line]
Field: Item Name
Aggregate: Opening Quantity, Opening Bags
Aggregate: Inward Quantity, Inward Bags
Aggregate: Outward Quantity, Outward Bags
Aggregate: Closing Quantity, Closing Bags

; ==========================================
; END OF CONFIGURATION
; ==========================================
